# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
config RUST_UCOUNT
	bool "Rust user-namespace and resource-limit ucounts accounting"
	depends on RUST
	default y
	help
	  Build the user-namespace and resource-limit ucounts accounting bodies from kernel/ucount.rs in the
	  original kernel/ucount.o slot, with native companions for configured
	  primitives, storage and metadata. Turning this option off selects
	  the unchanged original C provider.
